      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you rely on a tool for work, it should open like the rest of your apps and remind you when something needs your attention.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/install-as-app",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
